<div id="anp_a" class="d-panel p" style="display: none"><div class="notes p"><section id="historyarticle-meta1" class="history"><p>Received 2025 Oct 6; Revised 2025 Nov 13; Accepted 2025 Dec 4; Collection date 2025 Dec.</p></section></div></div>
